<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <title>Be Patient ❤️</title>

    <style>
        body {
            background: #111;
            color: white;
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            text-align: center;
            padding-top: 25vh;
        }

        h1 {
            font-size: 40px;
            animation: fade 3s infinite alternate;
        }

        p {
            font-size: 20px;
            color: #ccc;
        }

        @keyframes fade {
            from { opacity: 0.4; }
            to { opacity: 1; }
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>

    <h1>❤️</h1>

    <h1>It takes time to fall in love.</h1>

    <p>Be patient. The right feelings don't need to be rushed.</p>

</body>
</html>
